# A six-joint robot arm with sphere joints and capsule links.
scene "Robot Arm"

material: steel
baseR = cylinder(r: 9cm, h: 3cm) color: dimgray
columnR = cylinder(r: 3.5cm, h: 30cm) at (0, 3cm, 0)
shoulderR = sphere(r: 4.5cm) at (0, 33cm, 0) color: gold
lowerR = capsule(r: 3cm, h: 28cm) rotate (0, 0, -60deg) at (0, 36cm, 0)
elbowR = sphere(r: 4cm) at (14cm, 48cm, 0) color: gold
upperR = capsule(r: 2.5cm, h: 24cm) rotate (0, 0, -25deg) at (12cm, 52cm, 0)
wristR = sphere(r: 3cm) at (24cm, 62cm, 0) color: gold
ask "how many objects?"
